{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">啟德醫院今日起分階段投入服務，首日街症籌已經額滿。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">在上午8時半，位於第4座專科門診大樓1樓的家庭醫學綜合中心率先啟用，陸續有市民來看門診，有職員及醫護人員帶路，以及解答疑問。初時每日有350個街症籌。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.HOSPITAL-0830_003.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026dsokRBna9l1791166310.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.HOSPITAL-0830_003.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">藥劑部配合門診同步啟用，專科門診、抽血站等要到本月下旬才分階段啟用。診症室的數量增至235間，預計每年服務140萬人次。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.HOSPITAL-0830_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026VhKzwp9EuK1791162305.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.HOSPITAL-0830_001.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">醫管局表示，會逐一致電通知要到新醫院覆診的病人。若去錯地方，伊利沙伯醫院會有醫生候命，即場為病人看診。啟德醫院是本港最大規模公立醫院，伊利沙伯醫院的醫療服務會循序漸進轉移至啟德醫院。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><a class=\"tiptap-link\" href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1198929-%E5%95%9F%E5%BE%B7%E9%86%AB%E9%99%A2%E5%91%A8%E4%B8%80%E5%95%9F%E7%94%A8%E6%9C%89%E7%97%85%E4%BA%BA%E5%AE%B6%E5%B1%AC%E6%8F%90%E6%97%A9%E7%86%9F%E7%BF%92%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A%E9%86%AB%E7%AE%A1%E5%B1%80%E7%A8%B1%E6%9C%83%E9%80%90%E4%B8%80%E9%80%9A%E7%9F%A5%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%86%E8%A8%BA%E4%BA%BA%E5%A3%AB\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_self\">啟德醫院不近港鐵站　一按即睇交通方法</a></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-05T02:58:11.397476+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":273,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}